Package: hyprland-anland-desktop
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 hyprland (= ${binary:Version}),
 dms,
 xwayland,
 xdg-desktop-portal,
 xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland,
 xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: Complete Anland Hyprland touch desktop
 This metapackage installs the complete ARM64 Anland desktop session: the
 Debian-patched Hyprland compositor, Dank Material Shell, Xwayland, desktop
 portals, and their runtime dependencies.
 .
 Install it together with the patched xwayland .deb produced by this source
 tree, then start the session with start-hyprland-anland.
